==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Unified Minds|Lurantis|16}} from the {{TCG|Unified Minds}} expansion, which also has the Petal Blizzard attack.
*{{m|Petal Blizzard}} is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Lurantis}} can learn.
